	(text "MONO: U3A sums the two gain-stage outputs (before the 1k, so a load on OUT L/R\ndoes not move MONO): MONO = -0.51 x (GAIN_L + GAIN_R) = +10 x (L + R) at the inputs.\nOUT L/R are inverted (BM topology); MONO is in phase. U3B unused: grounded follower."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 118.11 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "06636ea2-aeac-5ce2-985a-f62816e4bd16")
	)
	(text "POWER: Eurorack +12V / -12V -> B5819W per rail -> +12V / -12V (about +/-11.6 V). J10 +5V unused.\nC3..C8: 100n at every op-amp supply pin; C1/C2: 10u bulk."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 33.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "73c00401-46c0-53d6-9e41-e7e7c7cf80c2")
	)
	(text "BIG MODULAR LINE IN - S3 schematic: stereo line input to Eurorack level (Bread Modular line_in on +/-12 V). Circuit intent: docs/research.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8a54d419-b468-5430-91d6-51be6e25452b")
	)
	(text "PWR_FLAG: #FLG01 marks the Eurorack GND; #FLG02/#FLG03 mark the +12V/-12V rails,\nfed from the header only through D1/D2, which ERC cannot see through."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 86.36 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "cedb88c1-9ce4-587f-b72f-f62396a1c4ba")
	)
	(text "CHANNELS L/R (Bread Modular line_in, ground-referenced): J1 tip/ring -> 50k LEVEL pot -> 1u / 1M bias -> 10k current limit -> low-leakage clamps\n-> follower -> 5.1k -> inverting gain (100k || 20p) = -19.6 (~x20, Doepfer A-119) -> 1k -> OUT jack.\nD3..D6: opposite two-diode strings to GND, not MIDI transistor shaping. Powered mis-patch protection; bench validation pending."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 96.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.4 1.4)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "d6271793-42b4-574e-ae82-9b19831f4ef4")
	)
